00:00:35.286 --> 00:00:36.771
and I'll sign either one.

00:00:36.771 --> 00:00:38.788
- You know that awful rich
kid in elementary school

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:41.246
who you only talked to
because they had the best room

00:00:41.246 --> 00:00:42.620
and the best video games?

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.560
That's me and I'm running
for president now!

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.030
- I switched political
parties more than three times,

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.841
