them without having to learn

00:00:58.102 --> 00:00:59.776
how to run sustainable companies.

00:00:59.776 --> 00:01:01.772
- If I offend you, get out of my country!

00:01:01.772 --> 00:01:03.984
But if you offend me,
I'll demand an apology.

00:01:03.984 --> 00:01:06.547
I'm just like extremely
hypocritical in that way.

00:01:06.547 --> 00:01:10.587
- Money can't buy you love,
that's something I've learned.

00:01:10.587 --> 00:01:14.757
- I have surrounded myself with "yes" men

00:01:14.757 --> 00:01:19.757
