know what's good and bad.

00:01:19.787 --> 00:01:22.275
- I don't let myself get
weighed down by what's true.

00:01:22.275 --> 00:01:25.053
Thousands of people
celebrated 9/11 in New Jersey,

00:01:25.053 --> 00:01:27.010
and I shot the Loch Ness monster.

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.373
He (bleep) me in a land deal.

00:01:28.373 --> 00:01:29.881
- Have I mentioned I'm racist?

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:31.517
- You hear about this Jesus guy?

00:01:31.517 --> 00:01:34.447
I feel bad for him, he was
always looking to help the poor.

00:01:34.447 --> 00:01:35.984
I mean, it's why I'm not religious.

00:01:35.984 --> 00:01:38.564
Not unless I have to be
for political campaigns.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:41.627
- If you disagree with me, shut up.

00:01:41.627 --> 00:01:44.648
But if you disagree with me, shut up.

00:01:46.611 --> 00:01:47.860
Yeah, that's right.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:50.401
- Remember how I was wrong
about Obama's birth certificate?

00:01:50.401 --> 00:01:52.244
